# Solution Script standards

The Scripts/EH Solutions folder contains all the Decade program solution scripts
- All scripts should be UPPER CASE and prefixed with EH_. For example, EH_UPDATE_GUIDESHEET_ITEMS
- Each script should address a particular solution
- When deploying to projects, the EH_% script should be copied to the agency’s EH Solutions folder and included via a single line from the event script.
- Solution scripts can use helper functions